# Build artifacts
target/
crates/*/target/

# Assembled AppImage tree — pure build output. `build-appimage.sh` does
# `rm -rf` on it and reassembles from target/ and assets/ on every run, so
# tracking it just wrote a fresh ~150 MB of binaries into history per rebuild.
# The inputs (AppRun, build-appimage.sh) ARE tracked; the output is not.
# Shipped artifacts go to the GitHub Releases page.
packaging/appimage/AppDir/
*.AppImage

# MSFS 2024 SDK installer — Microsoft's redistributable, local reference only.
# 468 MB, and not ours to publish.
tools/MSFS2024_SDK_Core_Installer_*/

# Verbatim Microsoft SDK documentation, kept locally as the source material the
# Camera API wire protocol was reverse-engineered from. Our own account of that
# protocol is docs/SIMCONNECT_CAMERA_API_WIRE.md, which is what we publish.
camera_api_info.txt

# GUI design mockup — a scratch file, not a product asset.
assets/headtrackrs.html

# Personal notes and local docs
My_Notes.txt
roadmap.txt
Research\ Documents/

# Local test data — diagnostic CSV recordings
TesterCSVData/

# Snow Leopard draw-down safety net — pre-deletion copies of removed files.
# Local recovery only; never committed.
archive/

# Markdown is private by default: docs/ holds working engineering notes
# (flight logs, investigation histories, draw-down plans) written for us.
# The exceptions are the documents README.md links to, which must resolve
# on GitHub: the changelog and the user-facing capture guide.
# Note `docs/*` rather than `docs/` — git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so the negation below would never be reached.
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
docs/*
!docs/CONTRIBUTING_DATA.md
# Licence notices must ship with the code (P16, 2026-10-18): the third-party notices,
# and the Apache-2.0 NOTICE beside the MediaPipe models. build-appimage.sh copies both.
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!assets/models/tobii/NOTICE.md
# Upstream tract-tflite file, hash-pinned by vendor/tract-tflite/TRACT_SNAPSHOT.json
# (tract_snapshot_hashes_verify fails in a clone without it; found by the P16 clean build).
!vendor/tract-tflite/Readme.md

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# Secrets / local config overrides
*.env
config.local.toml
.aider*

# Images of people are never published (maintainer, 2026-10-03, hardline). These .f32
# tensors are IR images of a real face (256x256 crop + 128x128 frame) stored as floats.
crates/headtrack-input-tobii/tests/fixtures/parity-initial-*/
# Google's model-card PDFs embed raster photographs (P16, 2026-10-18). Kept locally as
# licence evidence; never published or bundled. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES links the originals.
assets/models/tobii/*.pdf

# Local dated source tarballs (taskmaster). Never published; may contain local-only fixtures.
backups/

# Local-only tool state (P16, 2026-10-18): Claude Code's per-machine permission rules and
# the taskmaster's backup-pruning rule. Neither belongs in a public repo.
.claude/settings.local.json
.backup-retention
# Local undo areas (2026-11-14): removed files and per-session edit snapshots.
.trash/
.snapshots/
